---
import wordmarkUrl from '../../docs/brand/masters/wordmark/iroa-wordmark-color.svg?url';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="site-footer__inner container">
    <div class="site-footer__identity">
      <a class="site-footer__brand" href="/" aria-label="IROA.AI 홈으로 돌아가기">
        <img src={wordmarkUrl} alt="" width="600" height="180" />
      </a>
      <p>현실 세계를 위한 검증 가능한 실행 네트워크.</p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="보조 메뉴">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/#protocol">프로토콜</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#network">네트워크</a></li>
        <li><a href="/whitepaper">백서</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#roadmap">로드맵</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <p class="site-footer__legal">© {currentYear} IROA.AI</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-block-start: clamp(var(--space-12), 8vw, 7rem);
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface-soft);
  }

  .site-footer__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    padding-block: var(--space-10);
  }

  .site-footer__identity {
    max-inline-size: 30rem;
  }

  .site-footer__brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-inline-size: var(--control-min);
    min-block-size: var(--control-min);
    align-items: center;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .site-footer__brand img {
    inline-size: 8.5rem;
    block-size: auto;
  }

  .site-footer__identity p,
  .site-footer__legal {
    margin-block-end: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .site-footer ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .site-footer nav a {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-inline-size: var(--control-min);
    min-block-size: var(--control-min);
    align-items: center;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .site-footer nav a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  .site-footer__legal {
    font-family: var(--font-latin);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .site-footer__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .site-footer__legal {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      padding-block-start: var(--space-5);
      border-block-start: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }
  }
</style>
